": 20.68, "end": 23.7, "text": " pas au réveillé, sinon tu gestes les urgences des autres.", "words": [{"word": " pas", "start": 20.68, "end": 21.14}, {"word": " au", "start": 21.14, "end": 21.26}, {"word": " réveillé,", "start": 21.26, "end": 21.72}, {"word": " sinon", "start": 21.74, "end": 22.24}, {"word": " tu", "start": 22.24, "end": 22.44}, {"word": " gestes", "start": 22.44, "end": 22.82}, {"word": " les", "start": 22.82, "end": 22.92}, {"word": " urgences", "start": 22.92, "end": 23.38}, {"word": " des", "start": 23.38, "end": 23.46}, {"word": " autres.", "start": 23.46, "end": 23.7}]}, {"start": 24.54, "end": 25.86, "text": " Franchement, mise bout à pisse,", "words": [{"word": " Franchement,", "start": 24.54, "end": 24.98}, {"word": " mise", "start": 25.02, "end": 25.32}, {"word": " bout", "start": 25.32, "end": 25.48}, {"word": " à", "start": 25.48, "end": 25.6}, {"word": " pisse,", "start": 25.6, "end": 25.86}]}, {"start": 25.98, "end": 27.56, "text": " ça peut te rendre deux heures par jour.", "words": [{"word": " ça", "start": 25.98, "end": 26.26}, {"word": " peut", "start": 26.26, "end": 26.42}, {"word": " te", "start": 26.42, "end": 26.52}, {"word": " rendre", "start": 26.52, "end": 26.72}, {"word": " deux", "start": 26.72, "end": 27.02}, {"word": " heures", "start": 27.02, "end": 27.22}, {"word": " par", "start": 27.22, "end": 27.34}, {"word": " jour.", "start": 27.34, "end": 27.56}]}], "text": " Et si tes matins te volaisent deux heures par jour ?  Trois habitudes pour les récupérer.  1. Pas de téléphone la première heure,  parce que juste deux minutes sur une app,  ça finit souvent en une demi-heure.  2. Tu choisis ta tâche la plus importante l'avenir,  comme ça au réveillé t'attaques direct.  3. Tes mails et ton message, c'est à heure fixe,  pas au réveillé, sinon tu gestes les urgences des autres.  Franchement, mise bout à pisse,  ça peut te rendre deux heures par jour."}